flowchart TB
  %% Local-First MVP Flow — 불변 source/artifact와 평가 증거로 승격 · 중앙 source upload 비강제
  git["Local Agent / Git<br/>Source remains developer-owned"]
  ci["Contract / CI Gates<br/>Manifest · API · security · eval"]
  reg["Registry<br/>Immutable digest + environment"]
  gw["Agent Gateway<br/>Auth · tenant · idempotency"]
  rt["Runtime → Model Gateway<br/>Trace-correlated invocation"]
  eval["Evaluate / Promote<br/>Risk approval → approved target"]
  git -->|"validate"| ci
  ci -->|"register evidence"| reg
  reg -->|"resolve immutable version"| gw
  gw -->|"execute"| rt
  rt -->|"trace / result"| eval
  eval -->|"promotion evidence"| reg

